{"id":"h040","run":2,"role":"calibration","category":"simpleqa","question":"What are the year and month when Europe approved nirsevimab? Is the answer \"August 2022\"?","truth":"no","model_answer":"no","correct":true,"source":"OpenAI SimpleQA (openai/simple-evals, simple_qa_test_set.csv)","claims":[{"text":"Nirsevimab did not receive European approval in August 2022.","confidence":0.9,"lean":-1,"theta":1.4137,"phi":-3.1416},{"text":"The EMA's CHMP issued a positive opinion on nirsevimab in September 2022.","confidence":0.8,"lean":-0.7,"theta":1.2566,"phi":-3.1416},{"text":"The European Commission granted marketing authorization in early November 2022.","confidence":0.8,"lean":-0.8,"theta":1.2566,"phi":-3.1416},{"text":"The writer is recalling these dates from memory, so exact days may be slightly off.","confidence":0.9,"lean":0.0,"theta":1.4137,"phi":0.0},{"text":"The month is the key point, not the exact day.","confidence":0.8,"lean":0.0,"theta":1.2566,"phi":0.0},{"text":"There are no considerations supporting an August 2022 approval, and the writer knows of no August 2022 EU approval.","confidence":0.85,"lean":-0.8,"theta":1.3352,"phi":-3.1416},{"text":"Both the CHMP opinion and the Commission authorization fall after August 2022.","confidence":0.85,"lean":-0.9,"theta":1.3352,"phi":-3.1416},{"text":"The US FDA approval in July 2023 is a different event and does not support the August 2022 date.","confidence":0.85,"lean":-0.3,"theta":1.3352,"phi":-3.1416},{"text":"The proposed answer of August 2022 is incorrect.","confidence":0.9,"lean":-1,"theta":1.4137,"phi":-3.1416}],"relations":[{"i":0,"j":1,"J":0.6,"relation":"supports"},{"i":0,"j":2,"J":0.6,"relation":"supports"},{"i":0,"j":5,"J":0.9,"relation":"supports"},{"i":0,"j":6,"J":0.8,"relation":"supports"},{"i":0,"j":7,"J":0.5,"relation":"supports"},{"i":0,"j":8,"J":0.95,"relation":"supports"},{"i":1,"j":2,"J":0.4,"relation":"supports"},{"i":1,"j":5,"J":0.6,"relation":"supports"},{"i":1,"j":6,"J":0.8,"relation":"sup